OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain, this
OL,7,Fgradually becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fpatchy through the afternoon and
OL,9,Fevening. Windy at times, particularly
OL,10,Faround the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,13,Fand fresh winds clearing early
OL,14,FSaturday. Further rain or showers over
OL,15,Fthe weekend with some drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,17,Flight, likely freshening later on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
